    {
      "q": "What should I do immediately during an emergency?",
      "a": "Call Triple Zero (000) immediately or TTY - 106. You can also call NSW SES on 132 500 or visit the NSW State Emergency Service (SES) website.",
      "link": "https://www.ses.nsw.gov.au"
    },
    {
      "q": "Where can I check for road closures or traffic updates?",
      "a": "You can go to Live Traffic NSW or call 132 701 to check if roads are clear.",
      "link": "https://www.livetraffic.com"
    },
    {
